D_rmd_refMultipleDDicts(1)]` L1843-1844 | `dctx->refMultipleDDicts` L1932; **extra rejection**: `staticSize != 0 → parameter_unsupported` (L1929-1931) | `ZSTD_rmd_refSingleDDict` L247 |\n| `ZSTD_d_disableHuffmanAssembly` | `experimentalParam5` = 1004 (zstd.h:2577) | `[0,1]` L1847-1848 | `dctx->disableHufAsm = value != 0` L1936 | 0 (L248) |\n| `ZSTD_d_maxBlockSize` | `experimentalParam6` = 1005 (zstd.h:2593) | `[ZSTD_BLOCKSIZE_MAX_MIN = 1<<10, ZSTD_BLOCKSIZE_MAX = 1<<17]` L1851-1852; **0 bypasses the check** (`if (value != 0) CHECK_DBOUNDS`, L1939) | `dctx->maxBlockSizeParam` L1940 | 0 = disabled (L249) |\n| anything else | — | `bounds.error = parameter_unsupported` L1857 | `RETURN_ERROR(parameter_unsupported)` L1944 | — |\n\nInternal effects downstream:\n- `format`: `ZSTD_startingInputLength` (L232-238) → `ZSTD_FRAMEHEADERSIZE_PREFIX(format)` = 5 vs 1; skips magic in `ZSTD_getFrameHeader_advanced` (L480-494); disables legacy/skippable dispatch in `ZSTD_decompressMultiFrame` (L1090, L1120) and `ZSTD_findFrameSizeInfo` (L740, L744).\n- `forceIgnoreChecksum`: `dctx->validateChecksum = fParams.checksumFlag && !forceIgnoreChecksum` (L720); still skips 4 bytes but no compare in `ZSTD_decompressFrame` (L1049-1059).\n- `maxBlockSizeParam`: clamps `fParams.blockSizeMax` in `ZSTD_decompressFrame` (L982-983) and in the stream loader (L2233-2234); feeds `ZSTD_decodingBufferSize_internal` (L2239) and `ZSTD_blockSizeMax()` (block .c L54-59).\n- `disableHufAsm` → `HUF_flags_disableAsm` in `ZSTD_decodeLiteralsBlock` (block .c L162).\n- `maxWindowSize` checked at L2231-2232 (`frameParameter_windowTooLarge`).\n\n`ZSTD_DCtx_setMaxWindowSize` L1804-1814 (independent: sets windowSize not log; min `1<<10`, max `1<<31`, requires `zdss_init`). `ZSTD_DCtx_setFormat` L1816-1819 = thin wrapper on `ZSTD_d_format`.\n\n## 2. `ZSTD_decompressStream` state machine (L2086-2390)\n\nEntry checks: `input->pos > input->size → srcSize_wrong` (L2100), `output->pos > output->size → dstSize_tooSmall` (L2105), `ZSTD_checkOutBuffer` (L2111; impl L2035-2050 — only enforced when `outBufferMode == ZSTD_bm_stable` and `streamStage != zdss_init`, else `dstBuffer_wrong`).\n\n- **`zdss_init`** (L2116-2125): transparent reset — `lhSize=inPos=outStart=outEnd=0`, `legacyVersion=0`, `hostageByte=0`, `expectedOutBuffer = *output`; falls through to `zdss_loadHeader`.\n- **`zdss_loadHeader`** (L2127-2271):\n  - legacy continuation: `if (zds->legacyVersion)` → `ZSTD_decompressLegacyStream`, `hint==0 → zdss_init`, returns hint (L2130-2136); static dctx rejected.\n  - `hSize = ZSTD_getFrameHeader_advanced(&fParams, headerBuffer, lhSize, format)` (L2138). refMultipleDDicts re-select at L2139-2141.\n  - error → legacy magic detection `ZSTD_isLegacy` → `ZSTD_initLegacyStream` (L2144-2159), else return hSize (L2161).\n  - **loadHeader partial-read path** (L2163-2183): `toLoad = hSize - lhSize`; if `toLoad > remainingInput`, copy remainder into `headerBuffer`, set `input->pos = input->size`, re-validate prefix, and return the hint `MAX(ZSTD_FRAMEHEADERSIZE_MIN(format), hSize) - lhSize + ZSTD_blockHeaderSize` (L2178). Otherwise copy `toLoad`, `lhSize = hSize`, `break` (re-enters loadHeader).\n  - **single-pass shortcut** (L2185-2202): requires `frameContentSize != ZSTD_CONTENTSIZE_UNKNOWN` && `frameType != ZSTD_skippableFrame` && `(oend-op) >= frameContentSize`; then `cSize = ZSTD_findFrameCompressedSize_advanced(istart, iend-istart, format)` and if `cSize <= (iend-istart)` calls `ZSTD_decompress_usingDDict(zds, op, oend-op, istart, cSize, ZSTD_getDDict(zds))`; sets `ip = istart+cSize`, `expected = 0`, `streamStage = zdss_init`, `someMoreWork = 0`.\n  - **stableOutBuffer sizing check** (L2204-2210): `bm_stable` + known fcs + `(oend-op) < frameContentSize` → `dstSize_tooSmall`.\n  - `ZSTD_decompressBegin_usingDDict(zds, ZSTD_getDDict(zds))` (L2214) — **dictionary-at-init**; `ZSTD_getDDict` (L1180-1195) resolves `ZSTD_dont_use` / `ZSTD_use_indefinitely` / `ZSTD_use_once` (prefix: consumed once