349-2389): `input->pos`/`output->pos` update; `expectedOutBuffer = *output` (L2354); no-forward-progress counter (`ZSTD_NO_FORWARD_PROGRESS_MAX` 16, L50-52) → `noForwardProgress_destFull` / `noForwardProgress_inputEmpty`.\n- **srcSizeHint / nextInputSizeHint** (L2366-2389): `nextSrcSizeHint = ZSTD_nextSrcSizeToDecompress(zds)`; if 0 → frame done: fully flushed + hostage logic (return 1 to hold a hostage byte, `input->pos--` L2380, released at L2375), else `return 1`. Nonzero → `+= ZSTD_blockHeaderSize * (ZSTD_nextInputType(zds) == ZSTDnit_block)`, then `-= inPos`.\n- `ZSTD_decompressStream_simpleArgs` L2392-2410.\n\n## 3. `ZSTD_decompressFrame` (L953-1066) / `ZSTD_decompressMultiFrame` (L1068-1169)\n\n`ZSTD_decompressFrame`:\n- `remainingSrcSize < ZSTD_FRAMEHEADERSIZE_MIN(format)+ZSTD_blockHeaderSize → srcSize_wrong` (L967-969).\n- header: `ZSTD_frameHeaderSize_internal(ip, ZSTD_FRAMEHEADERSIZE_PREFIX(format), format)` then `ZSTD_decodeFrameHeader` (L972-979).\n- maxBlockSize shrink L982-983.\n- block loop L986-1043: `ZSTD_getcBlockSize`; in-place guard `if (ip >= op && ip < oBlockEnd) oBlockEnd = op + (ip-op)` (L997-1012); dispatch `bt_compressed → ZSTD_decompressBlock_internal(..., not_streaming)` (L1018), `bt_raw → ZSTD_copyRawBlock` with full `oend` (memmove-safe, L1022), `bt_rle → ZSTD_setRleBlock(op, oBlockEnd-op, *ip, blockProperties.origSize)` (L1025), `bt_reserved/default → corruption_detected` (L1027-1029). Checksum update per block L1033-1035. `lastBlock` breaks L1042.\n- fcs verify L1045-1048; **checksum verify vs ignore** L1049-1059 (`remainingSrcSize<4 → checksum_wrong`; compare only if `!forceIgnoreChecksum`; always advances 4).\n- trace L1060; updates `*srcPtr`/`*srcSizePtr` L1063-1064.\n\n`ZSTD_decompressMultiFrame`:\n- `assert(dict==NULL || ddict==NULL)` L1080; if `ddict`, extracts content/size L1082-1085.\n- multi-frame loop condition `srcSize >= ZSTD_startingInputLength(dctx->format)` L1087.\n- **legacy dispatch** L1089-1118 (only `format==ZSTD_f