are **not even #included** (zstd_legacy.h:30-41), meaning `ZSTDv01_magicNumberLE`/`ZSTDv02_magicNumber`/`ZSTDv03_magicNumber`/`ZSTDv04_magicNumber` are undefined in that TU.\n\n**Magic numbers accepted by the shim (`ZSTD_isLegacy`, zstd_legacy.h:56-86):** exactly three, compared against `MEM_readLE32(src)`:\n\n| version | macro | value tested | zstd_legacy.h line |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 5 | `ZSTDv05_MAGICNUMBER` | `0xFD2FB525` | 75-77 |\n| 6 | `ZSTDv06_MAGICNUMBER` | `0xFD2FB526` | 78-80 |\n| 7 | `ZSTDv07_MAGICNUMBER` | `0xFD2FB527` | 81-83 |\n\n`srcSize<4` → 0; anything else → 0 (default, L84).\n\nTherefore:\n- `ZSTD_decompressLegacy` (zstd_legacy.h:121-193): only cases 5/6/7 are compiled in; 1/2/3/4 arms are `#if`-ed out; unmatched → `ERROR(prefix_unknown)`.\n- `ZSTD_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy` (zstd_legacy.h:195-267): only 5/6/7; else `compressedSize = ERROR(prefix_unknown)`, `decompressedBound = ZSTD_CONTENTSIZE_ERROR`.\n- `ZSTD_getDecompressedSize_legacy` (zstd_legacy.h:89-118): `version < 5` → 0, so only 5/6/7 can ever return non-zero.\n- `ZSTD_freeLegacyStreamContext` (275-298) / `ZSTD_initLegacyStream` (301-362) / `ZSTD_decompressLegacyStream` (366-445): cases 1/2/3 → `ERROR(version_unsupported)` (or `0` for init); case 4 is `#if`-ed out and falls into the `default:` group → also `version_unsupported`; only 5/6/7 active.\n\n**Full magic-number table (all versions, per header):**\n\n| version | header + line | magic |\n|---|---|---|\n| v01 | `/local/home/.../src/legacy/zstd_v01.h:86-87` | `ZSTDv01_magicNumber 0xFD2FB51E` (BE), `ZSTDv01_magicNumberLE 0x1EB52FFD` |\n| v02 | `zstd_v02.h:86` | `ZSTDv02_magicNumber 0xFD2FB522` |\n| v03 | `zstd_v03.h:86` | `ZSTDv03_magicNumber 0xFD2FB523` |\n| v04 | `zstd_v04.h:135` | `ZSTDv04_magicNumber 0xFD2FB524` |\n| v05 | `zstd_v05.h:153` | `ZSTDv05_MAGICNUMBER 0xFD2FB525` |\n| v06 | `zstd_v06.h:164` | `ZSTDv06_MAGICNUMBER 0xFD2FB526` |\n| v07 | `zstd_v07.h:180` | `ZSTDv07_MAGICNUMBER 0xFD2FB527` |\n\nExtra magics in the **active** set:\n- `zstd_v07.c:41` `ZSTDv07_MAGIC_SKIPPABLE_START 0x184D2A50U` (mask `0xFFFFFFF0`) — skippable frames, handled inside v07 only.\n- Dictionary magics: `zstd_v05.c:390` `ZSTDv05_DICT_MAGIC 0xEC30A435`; `zstd_v06.c:399` `ZSTDv06_DICT_MAGIC 0xEC30A436`; `zstd_v07.c:2636` `ZSTDv07_DICT_MAGIC 0xEC30A437`.\n\n**Shim consumers:** `/local/home/.../src/decompress/zstd_decompress.c:73` and `/local/home/.../src/decompress/zstd_ddict.c:28` (`# include \"../legacy/zstd_legacy.h\"`); DStream state fields `legacyContext / previousLegacyVersion / legacyVersion` at `/local/home/.../src/decompress/zstd_decompress_internal.h:183-187`.\n\n---\n\n## A.2 Exported entry points per header (exact signatures)\n\n### v01 — `/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-iPPPON/c_src/src/legacy/zstd_v01.h` (NOT dispatch-reachable)\n- L35 `size_t ZSTDv01_decompress(void* dst, size_t maxOriginalSize, const void* src, size_t compressedSize);`\n- L48 `void ZSTDv01_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy(const void *src, size_t srcSize, size_t* cSize, unsigned long long* dBound);`\n- L54 `unsigned ZSTDv01_isError(size_t code);`\n- L60 `typedef struct ZSTDv01_Dctx_s ZSTDv01_Dctx;`\n- L61 `ZSTDv01_Dctx* ZSTDv01_createDCtx(void);`\n- L62 `size_t ZSTDv01_freeDCtx(ZSTDv01_Dctx* dctx);`\n- L64 `size_t ZSTDv01_decompressDCtx(void* ctx, void* dst, size_t maxOriginalSize, const void* src, size_t compressedSize);` — note `void*` ctx, not typed\n- L71 `size_t ZSTDv01_resetDCtx(ZSTDv01_Dctx* dctx);`\n- L73 `size_t ZSTDv01_nextSrcSizeToDecompress(ZSTDv01_Dctx* dctx);`\n- L74 `size_t ZSTDv01_decompressContinue(ZSTDv01_Dctx* dctx, void* dst, size_t maxDstSize, const void* src, size_t srcSize);`\n- No ZBUFF, no getFrameParams, no dict API.\n\n### v02 — `.../legacy/zstd_v02.h` (NOT dispatch-reachable)\nIdentical shape to v01 with `v02` prefix:\n- L35 `size_t ZSTDv02_decompress(void* dst, size_t maxOriginalSize, const void* src, size_t compressedSize);`\n- L48 `void ZSTDv02_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy(const void *src, size_t srcSize, size_t* cSize, unsigned long long* dBound);`\n- L54 `unsigned ZSTDv02_isError(size_t code);`\n- L60-62 `typedef struct ZSTDv02_Dctx_s ZSTDv02_Dctx;` / `ZSTDv02_Dctx* ZSTDv02_createDCtx(void);` / `size_t ZSTDv02_freeDCtx(ZSTDv02_Dctx*);`\n- L64 `size_t ZSTDv02_decompressDCtx(void* ctx, void* dst, size_t maxOriginalSize, const void* src, size_t compressedSize);`\n- L71 `size_t ZSTDv02_resetDCtx(ZSTDv02_Dctx* dctx);`\n- L73 `size_t ZSTDv02_nextSrcSizeToDecompress(ZSTDv02_Dctx* dctx);`\n- L74 `size_t ZSTDv02_decompressContinue(ZSTDv02_Dctx* dctx, void* dst, size_t maxDstSize, const void* src, size_t srcSize);`\n\n### v03 — `.../legacy/zstd_v03.h` (NOT dispatch-reachable)\nSame shape, `v03` prefix: L35 decompress, L48 findFrameSizeInfoLegacy, L54 isError, L60-62 typedef/create/free, L64 `decompressDCtx(void* ctx, ...)`, L71 resetDCtx, L73 nextSrcSizeToDecompress, L74 decompressContinue.\n\n### v04 — `.../legacy/zstd_v04.h` (NOT dispatch-reachable) — first version with ZBUFF\n- L35 `size_t ZSTDv04_decompress(void* dst, size_t maxOriginalSize, const void* src, size_t compressedSize);`\n- L48 `void ZSTDv04_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy(const void *src, size_t srcSize, size_t* cSize, unsigned long long* dBound);`\n- L54 `unsigned ZSTDv04_isError(size_t code);`\n- L60-62 `typedef struct ZSTDv04_Dctx_s ZSTDv04_Dctx;` / `ZSTDv04_Dctx* ZSTDv04_createDCtx(void);` / `size_t ZSTDv04_freeDCtx(ZSTDv04_Dctx*);`\n- L64 `size_t ZSTDv04_decompressDCtx(ZSTDv04_Dctx* dctx, void* dst, size_t maxOriginalSize, const void* src, size_t compressedSize);` (typed, unlike v01-v03)\n- L72 `size_t ZSTDv04_resetDCtx(ZSTDv04_Dctx* dctx);`\n- L74 `size_t ZSTDv04_nextSrcSizeToDecompress(ZSTDv04_Dctx* dctx);`\n- L75 `size_t ZSTDv04_decompressContinue(ZSTDv04_Dctx* dctx, void* dst, size_t maxDstSize, const void* src, size_t srcSize);`\n- L88 `typedef struct ZBUFFv04_DCtx_s ZBUFFv04_DCtx;`\n- L89 `ZBUFFv04_DCtx* ZBUFFv04_createDCtx(void);`\n- L90 `size_t ZBUFFv04_freeDCtx(ZBUFFv04_DCtx* dctx);`\n- L92 `si